flowchart TD
    TaskIn([Incoming Task Request]) --> IdentifyTask[Identify Task Type:\nTranscription | Alignment | VAD | Filler | Take Ranking | Reasoning]
    IdentifyTask --> LookupCaps[Query Provider Registry for Required Capability]
    
    LookupCaps --> CheckFreeOnly{Free-Only Protection Enabled?}
    
    CheckFreeOnly -- Yes --> FilterPaid[Filter Out All Paid-Only Models & Non-Free Endpoints]
    CheckFreeOnly -- No --> CheckBudget{Configured Budget Exceeded?}
    CheckBudget -- Yes --> RejectBudget[Raise BudgetExceededError & Fall Back to Free/Local]
    CheckBudget -- No --> KeepEligible[Keep Both Free and Allowed Paid Endpoints]
    FilterPaid --> KeepEligible

    KeepEligible --> FilterLocalPreference{User Preference: Local-First?}
    FilterLocalPreference -- Yes --> PrioritizeLocal[Prioritize Local Models: MLX-Whisper, Silero, Local Heuristics]
    FilterLocalPreference -- No --> PrioritizeSpeed[Prioritize Fast Cloud Free: Groq, Gemini Flash, Cerebras]

    PrioritizeLocal --> CheckHealth{Target Engine Available & Memory Within 16GB Budget?}
    PrioritizeSpeed --> CheckHealth

    CheckHealth -- No --> FailoverNext[Try Next Eligible Engine in Priority Order]
    CheckHealth -- Yes --> RouteEngine[Dispatch Task to Engine]

    RouteEngine --> ExecuteCall[Execute API Call or Run Local Inference]
    ExecuteCall --> CallSuccess{Call Succeeded?}

    CallSuccess -- Yes --> RecordUsage[Update Local Usage Tracker & Record Latency]
    RecordUsage --> ReturnResult([Return Task Output])

    CallSuccess -- No --> AnalyzeError{Error Type}
    AnalyzeError -->|Rate Limit / 429| MarkRateLimited[Cooldown Provider for N seconds]
    AnalyzeError -->|Auth / 401 / 403| DisableProvider[Flag Invalid API Key & Alert User]
    AnalyzeError -->|Network Failure / 5xx| IncrErrorCount[Increment Temporary Failure Count]
    AnalyzeError -->|OOM / Model Crash| UnloadModel[Evict Local Model & Free Unified Memory]

    MarkRateLimited --> FallbackEngine[Select Fallback Engine from Registry]
    DisableProvider --> FallbackEngine
    IncrErrorCount --> FallbackEngine
    UnloadModel --> FallbackEngine

    FallbackEngine --> CheckRemaining{Any Eligible Engine Left?}
    CheckRemaining -- Yes --> RouteEngine
    CheckRemaining -- No --> GracefulFailure([Abort Task with Clear Diagnostics & Safe Local Alternative])
